Switchboard Crew includes code adapted from savvy-progress
(https://github.com/JohnnyVizz/claude-kit/tree/main/plugins/savvy-progress):
the pixel crab body, the group-per-motion drawing and walk animation in
hooks/crabs.ts, the dithered progress bar in hooks/draw.ts, and the shape of the
agent tracking in hooks/register.tsx. savvy-progress credits its crab as
Pixel Clawd from DockCrab (Clawdy). Its license follows.

